.DS_Store
._*
*~
*.swp
*.swo
.idea/

# The detailed development journal is local; publish CHANGELOG.md instead.
/v2/LOG.md

# Audit: publish plans/research/tools and required immutable inputs.
/v2/audit/*
!/v2/audit/*.py
!/v2/audit/README.md
